flowchart TD
 A([Cart and review payment]) --> B{Payment valid?}
 B -- No --> C[/Show error; stay in review/]
 C --> A
 B -- Yes --> D[Clear persisted review state]
 D --> E{Each line has stock?}
 E -- No --> F[/Error; return false/]
 F --> A
 E -- Yes --> G[Deduct products and materials]
 G --> H[(Separate writes: stock, movements, promo, sale, log)]
 H --> I{All writes succeed?}
 I -- No --> J[/Uncaught write error; partial state possible/]
 I -- Yes --> K([Clear cart and show receipt])
